# Feature Module Architecture
- Each feature encapsulates `components/`, `hooks/`, `api/`, `model/`.
- The ONLY public surface of a feature is its `index.ts`.
- Code outside a feature must import solely from `@/features/<feature-name>`.
- Internal files must never be directly imported by other features or components.
- See `docs/ai/architecture.md`.
